{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14051","headline":"甘泉诗 · 耿湋","name":"甘泉诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异井甘如醴，深仁远未涯。\n气寒堪破暑，源净自蠲邪。\n修绠悬冰甃，新桐荫玉沙。\n带星凝晓露，拂雾涌秋华。\n绿溢涵千仞，清泠饮万家。\n何能葛洪宅，终日闭烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}